FORGE.pub – Authors
===================

This project is published under the name "Robert Winter" — a fictional character from the novel Der EXPLOIT by Heiko Schubert. In the book, FORGE (the trading engine this project is derived from) is explained and plays a central role.

More about the story that inspired FORGE:

Der EXPLOIT — https://uag.de/buch/der-exploit/

An optional premium service (server-side calculated statistics, metrics, etc.) is operated by an independent external provider and is not provided by the author
